 r←Caller
⍝ Returns a reference to the namespace the failing function was running in.\\
⍝ `⎕RSI` holds the namespaces the functions on the stack were called from: the first one that is
⍝ neither HandleError nor its API is the one we are after. Falls back to `#`.\\
⍝ Namespace-scoped system variables like `⎕IO` and `⎕ML` must be read through this reference: read
⍝ directly inside HandleError they report HandleError's own values.
 r←⊃(⎕RSI~⎕THIS ⎕THIS.API),#
